          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On July 30, 1976, at approximately 2:51 PM, a witness was intrigued by a spherical, metallic-colored object that was stationary in the sky. No unusual noises were heard during the observation, which lasted 3 minutes, before the object disappeared to the East. No other testimonies about this phenomenon were collected, and we lack information about it.",
